8e5f2d585-1":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Is it cordless?","icon":"check_mark","row_content":"<p>Yes. USB-rechargeable so you're not tied to an outlet while cleaning.<\/p>","page":""}},"template--19031306928423__bb7d2784-ae42-434b-aece-ca60bb5e9aa5-1687916948e5f2d585-2":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"How long does it take to clean the grill?","icon":"check_mark","row_content":"<p>Most light-to-moderate residue can be handled in a few minutes. Heavier buildup may take longer.<\/p>","page":""}},"template--19031306928423__bb7d2784-ae42-434b-aece-ca60bb5e9aa5-1687916948e5f2d585-3":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"What's included in the bundle?","icon":"check_mark","row_content":"<p>Pit Smith Pro brush, The Pitmaster's Playbook (digital), a precision meat thermometer, a stainless smoker box, heat-resistant grill gloves (1472°F), and a signature basting brush set.<\/p>","page":""}},"template--19031306928423__bb7d2784-ae42-434b-aece-ca60bb5e9aa5-1687916948e5f2d585-4":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Is the Pitmaster's Playbook physical or digital?","icon":"check_mark","row_content":"<p>Digital — delivered as a PDF after purchase. Includes the Temperature Mastery chart, Summer Recipe Vault, Rubs & Sauce Lab, and Cookout Host's Field Guide.<\/p>","page":""}},"template--19031306928423__bb7d2784-ae42-434b-aece-ca60bb5e9aa5-1687916948e5f2d585-5":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Is this a good Father's Day gift?","icon":"check_mark","row_content":"<p>Yes. Built for dads, weekend grillers, hosts, and anyone who takes pride in the backyard cookout.<\/p>","page":""}},"template--19031306928423__bb7d2784-ae42-434b-aece-ca60bb5e9aa5-1687916948e5f2d585-6":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"What if he doesn't like it?","icon":"check_mark","row_content":"<p>The order is backed by the 60-Day Pitmaster Promise — full refund within 60 days.<\/p>","page":""}},"template--19031306928423__bb7d278